  "2026-08-25T05:07:45.082Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check evidence: searched all statuses for MCP host story stateless discovery long-running tasks MRTR subscriptions and released-agent workflow. pm-wo7x covers drift-free narrow tools only; no existing story owns the 2026-07-28 end-to-end journey."
  "2026-10-15T12:36:29.751Z","harness:claude-code","Journey verification against the PUBLISHED artifact @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.15 (2026-10-15, isolated sandbox tracker, no session state):\n\nstdio via npx (-p @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.15 pm-mcp) and via bunx (bun 1.4.3), one newline-delimited stream, no initialize: server/discover returned serverInfo version 2026.10.15, supportedVersions [\"2026-07-28\"], capabilities tools/resources/prompts/extensions, cacheScope; tools/list returned 14 tools with ttlMs 30000 and cacheScope private; tools/call pm_context against the sandbox returned resultType complete with structuredContent; resources/list returned 4 resources; ping returned the allocated -32601 \"MCP method not found: ping\" with data.removedIn 2026-07-28; a legacy initialize (2025-11-25) still answered on the bounded stdio adapter with serverInfo/capabilities. Each request carried its own request-local version, client capabilities and client info; nothing depended on a prior request.\n\nStreamable HTTP via npx pm-mcp-http (PM_MCP_HTTP_PORT, loopback, POST /mcp): server/discover, tools/list (14 tools, private, ttl 30000), resources/list (4) and tools/call pm_context (resultType complete, summary active 4 / total 4) all succeeded as independent requests without a session header. Refusals were typed and actionable: an Origin that is not allow-listed is refused; a body/header method mismatch returns -32020 naming the Mcp-Method header; tools/call without Mcp-Name names that header; MCP-Protocol-Version 2024-11-05 returns \"Unsupported protocol version\" with supported [\"2026-07-28\"] and the requested value; a legacy initialize over HTTP returns \"Missing required MCP request metadata\" listing the two required _meta keys.\n\nAutomated coverage of the remaining AC facets (input_required/MRTR, tasks, subscriptions, cancellation, deterministic token-bounded outputs) is the merged test suite: tests/integration/mcp-stateless-protocol.spec.ts (12 cases incl. real stdio process), tests/integration/mcp-streamable-http.spec.ts (20 cases), tests/integration/mcp-progressive-discovery.integration.spec.ts, tests/integration/mcp-handshake.spec.ts; all 14 sibling children of pm-rs9vry are closed. The packed/published agent transcript (npm, npx, bunx) is the Release workflow step \"Verify published package on npm, npx, and bunx\" (scripts/release/verify-installed-agent-session.mjs), green for v2026.10.15 (run 38675448313).\n"
